text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\nFlying', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, exile a creature card from your graveyard.\nUndying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'Create five 1/1 white Human creature tokens. If this spell was cast from a graveyard, create ten of those tokens instead.\nFlashback {7}{W}{W} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create two 1/1 white Human creature tokens.\nFateful hour — If you have 5 or less life, create five of those tokens instead.', 'Create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Deathtouch\nOther Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\nWhenever another Zombie you control dies, target opponent loses 1 life.', 'Deathtouch\nWhenever another nontoken creature dies, you may draw a card.', 'Destroy target Human creature.', 'Destroy target attacking creature.', 'Destroy target non-Vampire, non-Werewolf, non-Zombie creature.', 'Diregraf Ghoul enters the battlefield tapped.', 'Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Dismal Backwater enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Draw three cards, untap up to two lands, then discard a card.', 'Each player sacrifices two creatures.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 as long as it's a Human. Otherwise, it can't attack or block.", 'Equipped creature gets +3/+0.\nAs long as equipped creature is a Human, it has lifelink.\nEquip {3}', 'Equipped creature has first strike.\nAs long as equipped creature is a Human, it gets +1/+1.\nEquip {1}', 'Equipped creature has flying.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', "Exile any number of target creatures you control. Return those cards to the battlefield under their owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Exile target creature and all other creatures with the same name as that creature.\nFlashback {5}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Exile target creature you control, then return it to the battlefield under its owner's control.\nFlashback {3}{U} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", "First strike\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Abattoir Ghoul this turn dies, you gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\nWhen Village Bell-Ringer enters the battlefield, untap all creatures you control.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAs long as Dearly Departed is in your graveyard, each Human creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', "Flying\nWhen Emancipation Angel enters the battlefield, return a permanent you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nWhen Goldnight Redeemer enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life for each other creature you control.', 'Flying\nWhen Gryff Vanguard enters the battlefield, draw a card.', "Flying\nWhen Mist Raven enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Flying\nWhen Topplegeist enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls.\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, tap target creature that player controls.", 'Flying\nWhen Tower Geist enters the battlefield, look at the top two cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Flying\nWhen Voice of the Provinces enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Human creature token.', 'Flying\nWhenever Falkenrath Noble or another creature dies, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nScrapskin Drake can block only creatures with flying.", 'Flying, trample\nWhen Mindwrack Demon enters the battlefield, mill four cards.\nDelirium — At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 4 life unless there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard.', "Gravecrawler can't block.\nYou may cast Gravecrawler from your graveyard as long as you control a Zombie.", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\nWhenever Geist of Saint Traft attacks, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying that's tapped and attacking. Exile that token at end of combat.", 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\nFlashback {6}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\nFlashback—Sacrifice three creatures. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand. Then that player discards a card if you control a Zombie.", 'Soulbond (You may pair this creature with another unpaired creature when either enters the battlefield. They remain paired for as long as you control both of them.)\nAs long as Spectral Gateguards is paired with another creature, both creatures have vigilance.', 'Soulbond (You may pair this creature with another unpaired creature when either enters the battlefield. They remain paired for as long as you control both of them.)\nAs long as Tandem Lookout is paired with another creature, each of those creatures has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, draw a card."', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a card from it with mana value 4 or greater and exile that card.', "Target opponent sacrifices a creature. You gain life equal to that creature's toughness.", 'Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Tranquil Cove enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', 'Unbreathing Horde enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each other Zombie you control and each Zombie card in your graveyard.\nIf Unbreathing Horde would be dealt damage, prevent that damage and remove a +1/+1 counter from it.', "Undying (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)", 'When Cathedral Sanctifier enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'When Doomed Traveler dies, create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'When Driver of the Dead dies, return target creature card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'When Elder Cathar dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. If that creature is a Human, put two +1/+1 counters on it instead.', "When Fiend Hunter enters the battlefield, you may exile another target creature.\nWhen Fiend Hunter leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Ghoulraiser enters the battlefield, return a Zombie card at random from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Screeching Skaab enters the battlefield, mill two cards.', 'When Seraph Sanctuary enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\nWhenever an Angel enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'When Slayer of the Wicked enters the battlefield, you may destroy target Vampire, Werewolf, or Zombie.', "When Tooth Collector enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.\nDelirium — At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, target creature that player controls gets -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Champion of the Parish.', 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, untap Captain of the Mists.\n{1}{U}, {T}: You may tap or untap target permanent.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token, then put a +1/+1 counter on each Zombie creature you control.', '{2}{W}: Moorland Inquisitor gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', '{3}{U}, {T}: Exile another target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under your control.', '{T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard.']
